	(text "RF detect: one LM2901 for the four antenna ports (D-47). DETk from antenna port Ak (BAS70 peak detector).\nThreshold VREF 0.3 V (R801/R802); DET above VREF pulls RFDETk low (active low, open collector, 10k pull-up to 3.3 V).\nHysteresis about 33 mV per channel (R81k 10k series, R82k 1M feedback). Supply +5V: common-mode range to VCC - 1.5 V;\ninputs rated to 36 V, DET max about 15 V at 100 W SWR 3. Detects about 0.5 W (SWR 1) to 2.5 W (SWR 3, voltage minimum).\nRFDET1 to RFDET4 go to the expander inputs. RFDET2 (A2, receive-only) also goes to J14 pin 17: the controller opens\nthe SAFE loop on RF at A2, so the shack inhibits all radios and the relays drop (D-104, SR-01 H2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "54ff6cc8-506d-521a-b5b0-f2a19dccc089")
	)
